# The npm package is an allowlist: exclude everything, then re-include what
# ships. npm always adds package.json, README.md and LICENSE on its own.
#
# Not package.json "files": vsce reads that field too and fails when a listed
# path is missing, and dist/ only exists once `prepack` has run. The VS Code
# extension's contents are set in .vscodeignore.
*
!dist/
!dist/o11-idx-color-theme.json
!CHANGELOG.md
